{"title": "其他", "index": 149, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre4\" id=\"KVCC0-f63310eb08dd4d5faea408e62c2fdc23\">\n<div class=\"calibre15\" id=\"chapter\">\n<h2 class=\"calibre19\" id=\"hh2-69\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-kai1\">附：<br class=\"calibre8\"/>\n<span class=\"font\">乐清县南宅殿后石照屏乩笔题狮子踏球图</span></span></h2>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-poem-center1\">天遣灵狮下，追球过海东。<br class=\"calibre15\"/>\n    身翻毛有色，目努力无穷。<br class=\"calibre15\"/>\n    声吼千山震，口呼一剑风。<br class=\"calibre15\"/>\n    举头惊百兽，善化石屏中。</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-center1\">殿后石照屏乩笔联语</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-poem-center\">云开日镜球生色　水受风梭剑有声</p>\n<p class=\"page-break\" id=\"calibre_pb_17\"></p>\n</div>\n</body>"}]}